---
import Shell from '../../layouts/NorthlineShell.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import '../../styles/v5.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
const asset = (file: string) => `${base}${file.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`;
const endpoint = String(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LEAD_ENDPOINT || '').trim();
---
<Shell title="Investor Brief | NORTHLINE" description="Build a seven-step fictional international real estate investor brief and explore sample property directions without mandatory contact submission.">
<div class="brief-route-intro container"><p class="section-kicker">NORTHLINE / INVESTOR BRIEF</p><h1>Find the right <span>starting point.</span></h1><p>Answer seven short questions and review transparent fictional scenarios. You do not need to share your contact details to view results.</p><a href={base}>← Return to the full site</a></div>
<section id="investor-brief" class="brief"><div class="container brief-grid"><div class="brief-brand-panel"><div class="section-kicker">06 / YOUR DECISION, IN FOCUS</div><div class="brand-graphic" aria-hidden="true">N<span>.</span></div><h2>A better brief.<br><span>A better starting point.</span></h2><p>Define what matters first. Then see examples that reflect your answers — without a mandatory contact gate.</p><a href={base}>← Back to the homepage</a></div><div class="quiz-interface" data-quiz data-assets={asset('assets/')}><div class="quiz-progress"><div><span>PERSONAL PROPERTY BRIEF</span><strong id="quiz-step-label" data-progress-label>01 / 07</strong></div><div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Investor brief progress" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="14" data-progress-track><span id="quiz-progress" data-progress-bar style="width:14%"></span></div></div><form id="investor-enquiry" data-capture-form data-endpoint={endpoint} action={`${base}api/lead`} method="post">
  <div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this blank<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div><fieldset data-quiz-step="0" ><legend>What budget range feels realistic?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="under-300k"><span>Under $300,000</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="300-600k"><span>$300,000–$600,000</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="600k-1m"><span>$600,000–$1 million</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="over-1m"><span>Above $1 million</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="1" hidden><legend>What should your property do for you?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="objective" value="income"><span>Rental income</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="objective" value="personal"><span>Personal use</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="objective" value="growth"><span>Long-term growth</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="objective" value="diversify"><span>Diversification</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="2" hidden><legend>Where are you looking?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="market" value="dubai"><span>Dubai</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="market" value="lisbon"><span>Lisbon</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="market" value="london"><span>London</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="market" value="open"><span>Open to several markets</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="3" hidden><legend>Which property stage?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="ready"><span>Ready / resale</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="offplan"><span>New-build / off-plan</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="both"><span>Open to either</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="4" hidden><legend>When might you decide?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline" value="now"><span>Within 3 months</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline" value="soon"><span>3–12 months</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline" value="later"><span>Over 12 months</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline" value="research"><span>Research stage</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="5" hidden><legend>How might you finance?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="financing" value="cash"><span>Cash</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="financing" value="loan"><span>Mortgage / financing</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="financing" value="mixed"><span>Cash and financing</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="financing" value="unknown"><span>Undecided</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="6" hidden><legend>Would you like to stay in touch?</legend><p>Contact details are optional to view example options and required only if you choose to submit an enquiry.</p><div class="quiz-contact"><label>Your name<input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name" minlength="2" required></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required></label></div><label class="quiz-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required><span>I agree to be contacted if I choose to submit an enquiry. <a href={`${base}privacy/`}>Privacy and demo notice</a>.</span></label></fieldset><p id="quiz-error" data-quiz-error class="quiz-error" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="quiz-actions"><button type="button" class="quiz-back" id="quiz-back" data-back hidden>← Back</button><button type="button" class="quiz-next" id="quiz-next" data-next>Continue <span>↗</span></button></div><div class="quiz-results" id="quiz-results" data-quiz-results hidden tabindex="-1" aria-live="polite"><p class="section-kicker">YOUR CONCEPT SHORTLIST</p><h3>Example directions for your brief.</h3><p id="quiz-results-summary" data-brief-summary></p><p hidden data-no-matches class="quiz-no-matches"></p><div id="quiz-matches" data-example-options class="match-list"></div><p class="fineprint">All options are fictional studies, not live listings or financial advice. Contact details are only transmitted after confirmed consent and with a configured secure endpoint.</p><button class="quiz-reset" id="quiz-reset" type="button">Revise answers ↺</button><button type="submit" class="quiz-submit">Send enquiry (demo) ↗</button><p data-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></form></div></div></section>
</Shell>